        "title": "Andy Li: Artist Workshop",
        "description": "<p class=\"intro\">Join Triennial artist Andy Li at Lot Lab in a family-friendly celebration of the everyday!</p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\">Li’s workshop begins with a demonstration of his interactive Triennial installation, Today Is The Day, and culminates in a flag-making workshop where visitors can choose and decorate a colorful flag of their own. Participants will be prompted to think about moments of their day to day experiences and share which one has brought them the most confidence and joy – waving your flags in the air with pride is encouraged.</p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\">This workshop is produced in partnership with the Boston Children’s Museum and is free and open to all.</p>",
