      {
        "title": "Community Concert at Bunker Hill",
        "description": "<h3>Community Concert</h3>\n<h4>Saturday, June 14, 5:00 p.m. - 7:00 p.m.</h4>\n<p><em>Bunker Hill Monument and Grounds</em></p>\n<p>The Bunker Hill Parade Committee will host its annual community concert on the Monument grounds. This year's event will feature the return of Jinty McGrath.</p>\n<p>To learn more about other commemorative events, please visit our page <a href=\"https://www.nps.gov/articles/000/bh-commemoration-week.htm\">Bunker Hill Commemoration Week 2025</a>.</p>",
