      {
        "title": "Flow + Restore Yoga",
        "description": "<p class=\"intro\">Connect to your natural surroundings and celebrate the opening of Lot Lab with a yoga class led by practitioner Lauren Bailey. Led in partnership with Boston Public Art Triennial.</p>\n<p class=\"preFade fadeIn\">Connect closely to your natural surroundings during an outdoor yoga class led by practitioner <a href=\"https://www.treaty0urself.com/\">Lauren Bailey.</a> There will be two separate one hour sessions: 9:00AM – 10:00AM and 10:15AM – 11:15AM. <strong>Registration required.</strong></p>",
