    {
      "title": "Flag Day Ceremony at Bunker Hill",
      "description": "<h3>Flag Day Ceremony</h3>\n<h4>Saturday, June 14, 10:00 a.m. - 11:00 a.m.</h4>\n<p><em>Memorial Flag Garden, Bunker Hill Monument and Grounds</em></p>\n<p>The National Parks of Boston, British Consulate, American Legion J.W. Conway Bunker Hill Post 26, and Homebase will host a Flag Day Ceremony at the memorial flag garden on the grounds of the Bunker Hill Monument. This Flag Day ceremony honors Colonial and British lives lost on the battlefield on June 17, 1775.</p>\n<p>To learn more about other commemorative events, please visit our page <a href=\"https://www.nps.gov/articles/000/bh-commemoration-week.htm\">Bunker Hill Commemoration Week 2025</a>.</p>",
