      "description": "<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW175477988 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW175477988 BCX0\">This iconic red and white lighthouse has been warning ships away from Eastham’s shores since 1923. Climb the tower and learn of its history and importance. Admission is free, but donations are accepted. Located at Nauset Light Beach, Eastham. </span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW175477988 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW175477988 BCX0\">Operated by Nauset Light Preservation Society: </span></span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW175477988 BCX0\" href=\"http://www.nausetlight.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"TextRun Underlined SCXW175477988 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW175477988 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">www.nausetlight.org</span></span></a><span class=\"TextRun SCXW175477988 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW175477988 BCX0\"> </span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW175477988 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\"> </span></p>",
