        "description": "<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\">2-3 hours, </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\">4-</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\">6</span> <span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\">miles</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\">. Join us for an energetic, cardiovascular hike to some of the most majestic ocean and bay views in the national seashore.</span> </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"A7\" data-ccp-charstyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;dedcbedf-24f5-4c85-a72c-b87400bfa31a|103&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469775450,&quot;A7&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;A7&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,134224900,&quot;true&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,469777841,&quot;NPS Rawlinson OT&quot;,469777842,&quot;NPS Rawlinson OT&quot;,469777843,&quot;ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,469777844,&quot;NPS Rawlinson OT&quot;,469769226,&quot;NPS Rawlinson OT,ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,335551500,&quot;0&quot;,268442635,&quot;18&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}\">Visit the e-vite link for weekly meeting location details and sign up information!</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW18625940 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\">https://evite.me/jtxjd6wx4m</span></p>",
