        "title": "Kayak the Outer Cape",
        "description": "<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\"><em>Timing each day is tide-dependent. Meeting time provided upon reservation.</em> For a different perspective on the seashore, join us or bring your own kayak and paddle with us in a meandering marsh or a dune-sided lake. Previous kayaking experience required; minimum age 12. </span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\">Reservations required and </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\">accepted no more than three days</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\"> in advance</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\">. </span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108823576 BCX0\">Call 508-487-1256 to register and get program time.</span></span></p>",
