      "title": "Old Harbor Life-Saving Station Open House",
      "description": "<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW69517276 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW69517276 BCX0\">D</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW69517276 BCX0\">rop in anytime between 2 and 4 pm. </span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW69517276 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW69517276 BCX0\">Built in 1898, Old Harbor is the last intact life-saving station of the original 13 on Cape Cod. A visit feels like stepping into a turn-of-the-century, working station while the crew is out on patrol. </span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW69517276 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW69517276 BCX0\">Race Point Beach, Provincetown. Beach fees may apply.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW69517276 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\"> </span></p>",
