      "description": "<p>Find out where you are in your galaxy!</p>\n<p>8:00-9:00 Join a ranger in the theater to find your address in our galaxy the Milky Way.</p>\n<p>9:00-10:00 Go outside and view the Milky Way in the prairie night sky. Star tour and constellation stories included.</p>\n<p>Bring layers to add as temperatures cool. Bug spray is recommended. Bring a red flashlight or a regular one that a ranger will adapt into a red one for you. A camp chair or blanket is recommended for the night sky viewing portion of the program.</p>",
