      "description": "<p>Harmony Star Straub will teach four beaded ornament classes in the style of her traditional Lakota heritage. The classes will start at 9:30am, 11:00am, 1:00pm, and 2:30pm. Ten slots are open for each class but others are welcome to observe. Supplies will be provided. Reservations are open for 7 of the 10 slots, leaving the open 3 to first come first served on site. Reserved spots will only be held for 15 minutes and then others present will be allowed in that spot.</p>\n<p>Have fun and express your creativity with a traditional Lakota beaded ornament! This is your chance to make a unique special holiday gift.</p>",
