      "title": "Fishing Clinic",
      "description": "<p>Learn how to Fish alongside park staff!</p>\n<p>Some topics that may be covered during a clinic include (but are not limited to):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The techniques behind casting and dehooking a fish</li>\n<li>Local species</li>\n<li>Local regulations</li>\n<li>Best times to fish</li>\n<li>History of fishing in the area</li>\n<li>How to tie knots</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Beginner Friendly!</p>\n<p>Fun for the whole family!</p>\n<p> </p>",
