      "title": "Park After Dark - Artist Reception",
      "description": "<div data-ogsc=\"black\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Saturday June 21st come meet artist <strong>MaiYap</strong> and experience the wonders of her solo art exhibit \"Echoes of the Land, Whispers of the Reef\" during June's Park After Dark. There are activities for the whole family throughout the afternoon, come enjoy s'mores in the park and use the extra time to catch that fish or take a walk with a friend. </div>\n<div data-ogsc=\"black\"> </div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\">\"Echoes of the Land, Whispers of the Reef\"</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\"><em><strong>Itinerary:</strong></em>  </h3>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Fishing Clinic: 2pm-4pm </h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Art Reception: 5pm-7pm </h4>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Hors d'oeuvres: 5pm-5:30pm </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Meet the Artist: 5:30pm-6pm </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Open Gallery: 6pm-7pm</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\"> </div>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Sunset Paddle*: 6:45pm-8:15pm  <br />*Must call to register, be an experienced paddler, and be 18+</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ogsc=\"black\">S'mores: 7:30pm-8:30pm </h4>\n<div data-ogsc=\"black\"> </div>\n<div data-ogsc=\"black\">To sign up for the sunset paddle please email <span data-ogsc=\"rgb(28, 43, 51)\"><a id=\"OWAe87b6ec4-99fc-6f36-caf7-5df6677b163b\" title=\"mailto:bisc_information@nps.gov\" href=\"mailto:bisc_information@nps.gov\" data-ogsc=\"rgb(28, 43, 51)\">bisc_information@nps.gov</a></span> or call the visitor center 786-335-3620. All paddlers must be experienced to participate.</div>",
