    {
      "title": "Parachute Shield Tour",
      "description": "<p><strong class=\"\">Duration</strong>: 60 minutes<br /><strong class=\"\">Distance</strong>: 0.6 miles / 1.3 kilometers<br /><strong class=\"\">Total Stairs</strong>: 0<br /><strong class=\"\">Difficulty</strong>: Moderate. Tour goers will be on their feet for the entire tour. Only the Inscription Room has seating.<br /><br /><strong class=\"\">White Nose Syndrome Screening is mandatory on all cave tours.</strong><br /><br />On the Parachute Shield Tour, your ranger will guide visitors from the Lodge Room through the Inscription Room, Cypress Swamp, Grand Palace, and finally to the Sunken Garden. Along the way, you'll discover cave shields, historic graffiti, and bubble trails - all testament to the cave's colorful past.<br /><br />Tours are limited to 20 without exception. <strong>All adults, children and toddlers need tickets</strong>. If you do not have enough tickets, you will not be allowed on the tour.</p>",
