    {
      "title": "\"Where We Converge\" Film Screening",
      "description": "<p>Join us for the premiere of \"Where We Converge,\" a brand new film dedicated to the rich history of Fort Vancouver National Historic Site!</p>\n<p>On Wednesday, July 30, we invite you to attend exclusive screenings at Pearson Air Museum at 11 am and 1 pm. Be among the first to see this 16-minute film that beautifully encapsulates the stories and significance of Fort Vancouver.</p>\n<p>The event will be introduced by Fort Vancouver NHS Supervisory Park Ranger Aaron Ochoa, who will share insights and context about this exciting project. After the premiere, \"Where We Converge\" will show regularly at the Fort Vancouver Visitor Center.</p>\n<p>Don’t miss this opportunity to experience the captivating history of Fort Vancouver like never before! We look forward to seeing you there!</p>\n<p> </p>",
